{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HEFTwPMcXvPc4m5VhG1hr4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Aurora â€” session-start playbook for Claude (Cowork / Claude Code)\n\n**What it is:** an always-on, multi-agent curation system that discovers, validates, and catalogs the open-source Claude/agent ecosystem, then surfaces relevant finds back into any Claude session. (Codename: *Always-on Understanding of Research, Operations, and Reasoning Agents* â€” `docs/NIGHTLY_SWEEP_PLAN.md:1-2`.)\n\n**Grounded claims:**\n\n- **It runs three nightly multi-agent \"sweeps\"** â€” Skills (23:00), Tools (00:00), Agents (22:00) â€” driven by `orchestrator.py --sweep {skills,tools,agents}`, using a scout â†’ quarantine â†’ screener â†’ critic-swarm â†’ librarian pipeline. (`CLAUDE.md` \"Aurora at a glance\"; plan Â§0 claims C1â€“C7.)\n\n- **It ships a SQLite knowledge base** at `kb/aurora.db` (verified present, ~28 MB, last written 2026-06-13) with versioned migrations (`kb/migrate.py`, `kb/schema.sql`) covering artifacts of four kinds â€” skills, tools, agents, and templates â€” plus `costs` and neural-plasticity tables (plan Â§6, change log v1â†’v2).\n\n- **It ships a browsable markdown library** (`library/` â€” `agents/`, `models/`, `papers/`, `skills/`, `templates/`, `tools/`, plus `_map.html`/`_model_grid.html`) and exec/briefing reports (`reports/morning/`, cost audits, model reports) â€” confirmed on disk.\n\n- **It publishes a scrubbed snapshot nightly** (~01:45) to a private `aurora-library` distribution repo via `publisher.py` (no transcripts; daily `YYYYMMDD` tags), separate from the `aurora-source` repo (plan Â§16; `CLAUDE.md` \"Key files\").\n\n- **It funnels every LLM call through `llm.py`** (retry/degrade/budget logic) under monthly Anthropic + Gemini spend caps, and registers its 5 scheduled tasks via Windows Task Scheduler (`bin/setup-tasks.ps1`) (plan change log v3â†’v4; `CLAUDE.md`).\n\n- **It surface